  "worked_solution": "To compute\n\n$$\n\\frac{2a{b}^{2}}{b{c}^{3}}\u00f7\\frac{8{a}^{3}}{7{c}^{4}},\n$$\n\nwe just need to multiply by the reciprocal of the divisor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2a{b}^{2}}{b{c}^{3}}\u00f7\\frac{8{a}^{3}}{7{c}^{4}} & = \\\\ \\frac{2a{b}^{2}}{b{c}^{3}}\\cdot \\frac{7{c}^{4}}{8{a}^{3}} & = \\\\ \\frac{2ab\\cdot b}{b{c}^{3}}\\cdot \\frac{7c\\cdot {c}^{3}}{4\\cdot 2a\\cdot {a}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\cancel{2a}b\\cdot \\cancel{b}}{\\cancel{b}\\cancel{{c}^{3}}}\\cdot \\frac{7c\\cdot \\cancel{{c}^{3}}}{4\\cdot \\cancel{2a}\\cdot {a}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{7bc}{4{a}^{2}} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
